 "content": "# Separator-tile classification rule\n\nUse this rule only for the demonstrated pattern with color-8 full-width/full-height separators, equal 2×3 tiles, mostly color 3 with occasional color 2, and an output cell per tile. Emit 1 for a tile containing at least two color-2 cells; emit 3 otherwise. Do not generalize this criterion to other tile layouts or colors without demonstration evidence.\n"
